        "payload": "tree 5c539ba42b00e7548e97e64266d9d10667a5bdb1\nparent 4dddf35d297a9c3ddd1da6589c90dac55706747e\nauthor Chris Lalancette <clalancette@gmail.com> 1786710214 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786710214 -0400\n\nCleanup the tests (#2469)\n\n* Remove printouts from the test plugin.\n\nThe main reason to do this is that, during development,\nthe test plugin gets installed as a \"regular\" plugin.\nThus when you run any \"ros2 bag\" commands, the plugin\ngets loaded and prints out spurious messages.\n\nThe real fix is to not install the test plugin alongside\nproduction plugins, but that is a larger fix.\n\nSigned-off-by: Chris Lalancette <clalancette@gmail.com>\n\n* Don't install test plugins into the \"production\" location.\n\nInstead utilize pluginlib_enable_plugin_testing() to install\nto the build directory, and then inject the path into the\ntests so they get found properly.\n\nSigned-off-by: Chris Lalancette <clalancette@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Chris Lalancette <clalancette@gmail.com>",
